{"slug":"-langley-acreages-over-4-acres-best-prices-in-years-8774922","path":"/blog.html/-langley-acreages-over-4-acres-best-prices-in-years-8774922","url":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/-langley-acreages-over-4-acres-best-prices-in-years-8774922","kind":"blog","title":"Langley Acreages Over 4 Acres – Best Prices in Years","canonical":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/-langley-acreages-over-4-acres-best-prices-in-years-8774922","seo":{"Title":"Langley Acreages Over 4 Acres – Best Prices in Years","Meta description":"Explore Langley acreages over four acres with strong pricing and long-term value potential. View market insights with Jared Gibbons.","H1":"Langley Acreages – Lifestyle, Space & Long-Term Value","Canonical":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/-langley-acreages-over-4-acres-best-prices-in-years-8774922","Meta robots":"","OG title":"Langley Acreages – Lifestyle, Space & Long-Term Value","OG description":"Explore Langley acreages over four acres with strong pricing and long-term value potential. View market insights with Jared Gibbons.","OG image":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/wps/rest/64736/blog/kske/kskewfymermf.jpg","Published":"2025-08-12T21:21:34+00:00","Modified":"2025-11-30T19:21:50+00:00"},"blocks":[{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"RSS","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.feed"}]},{"t":"h","level":1,"text":"Langley Acreages – Lifestyle, Space & Long-Term Value"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Posted on"},{"t":"August 12, 2025"},{"t":"by"},{"t":"Jared Gibbons","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/about.html"}],"cls":"byline"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Langley continues to attract acreage buyers seeking larger parcels, strong long-term land value, and flexible rural zoning options. This property category has become especially competitive as inventory under 5 acres remains limited while demand from both end-users and investors continues to rise. Buyers today are looking for agricultural potential, equestrian suitability, space for workshops or outbuildings, and proximity to key Langley corridors such as 16 Avenue, Fraser Highway, and Highway 1."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Many Langley acreage properties also qualify for farm status, reducing annual property taxes while providing excellent upside as surrounding communities expand. The market performance over the last year shows that well-priced acreages move quickly, particularly those with updated homes, modern septic systems, reliable wells, or potential for multi-generational use. This trend has contributed to strong absorption in Brookswood, Campbell Valley, Otter, and Murrayville."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Understanding zoning such as RU-1, RU-2, and ALR guidelines is essential, as each impacts buildability, accessory structures, and long-term land use. If you are exploring acreage opportunities, Langley continues to offer some of the best value in the Fraser Valley."}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Market Trends for Large Acreages"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Inventory remains limited, making competitively priced acreages especially appealing right now."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Featured Listings:"},{"t":"23296 32 Avenue, Langley","lead":true},{"t":"– 4.28 Acres, great location"},{"t":"View Listing »","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/recip.html/listing.23296-32-avenue-langley.106335587"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"25940 56 Avenue, Langley"},{"t":"– Ideal for multi-use farming or investment"},{"t":"View Listing »","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/recip.html/listing.25940-56-avenue-langley.106539006"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"21411 2 Avenue, Langley"},{"t":"– Surrounded by nature and privacy"},{"t":"View Listing »","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/recip.html/listing.21411-2-avenue-langley.105975538"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"1550 227 Street, Langley"},{"t":"– Excellent location for equestrian lovers"},{"t":"View Listing »","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/recip.html/listing.1550-227-street-langley.105844005"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"24960 Robertson Crescent, Langley"},{"t":"– Wide-open possib